[[Monk Labyrinthine armor]] is a [[prestige armor|prestige]] art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign in the [[Game updates/20070524|May 24th, 2007 update]]. 

The standard versions of this armor are [[Monk Dragon armor]] and [[Monk Star armor]], and there is also another prestige variant called [[Monk Flowing armor]].

